note Shared document chrome. Compose after runtime/json under one leading om2 directive.
note sc_begin stores bounded metadata; sc_route opens main; sc_end closes the document.
note Artifact integration supplies consent.html from PopupOnce and launcher.html from AllenPresence.
global sctitle uchar 2048
global scdesc uchar 8192
global sclens ulong 2
global scstate bool 3
global scarea ulong 1
text scroot "/"
text scnow "/now/"
text scznow "/zh-CN/now/"
text scallen "/allen/"
text scsi "SI"
text scomega "Omega"
text scmach "Machine"
text scdisco "Discoveries"
