text scfoot0 "<footer class=\"aien-footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-intro\"><a class=\"site-brand\" href=\"/\">Sovereign Intelligence</a><p>Built on AienOS. Made by Drake Stapleton.</p><p class=\"aien-reach-foot\"><a href=\"https://x.com/mdrakestapleton\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">X @mdrakestapleton</a> <a href=\"mailto:drake@aienos.com\">drake@aienos.com</a> <a href=\"/allen/\">Speak to Allen</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/aien-dev\">GitHub</a></p></div><nav class=\"footer-links\" aria-label=\"Explore more\"><a href=\"/\">SI</a><a href=\"/omega/\">Omega</a><a href=\"/machine/\">Machine</a><a href=\"/discoveries/\">Discoveries</a><a href=\"/learn/\">Learn</a><a href=\"/allen/\">Allen</a><a href=\"/turing/\">The Turing</a><a href=\"/experiments/\">Experiments</a><a href=\"/research/\">Research</a><a href=\"/evidence/\">Evidence</a><a href=\"/research/status/\">Research status</a><a href=\"/philosophy/\">Philosophy</a><a href=\"/post-llm-case/\">The Post-LLM Case</a><a href=\"/start/\">Start here</a><a href=\"/progress/\">Progress</a><a href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a><a href=\"/glossary/\">Glossary</a><a href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a><a href=\"/agents/\">Agent instructions</a><a href=\"https://interplane.io/\">Interplane</a><a href=\"https://www.drakestapleton.com\">Drake Stapleton</a></nav><p class=\"aien-footer-machines\">For machines: <a href=\"/data/index.json\">data index</a> · <a href=\"/llms.txt\">llms.txt</a> · <a href=\"/llms-full.txt\">full text</a> · <a href=\"/sitemap.md\">sitemap.md</a> · <a href=\"/AGENTS.md\">AGENTS.md</a> · <a href=\"/feed.xml\">feed</a> · <a href=\"/now/feed.xml\">ledger feed</a></p><p class=\"footer-quiet\"><a href=\"/#replay-intro\" data-site-replay>Replay the introduction</a> <a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy &amp; choices</a> <a href=\"/licensing/\">Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception</a></p><p class=\"muted\">AIEN © 2026. No outside fonts. X tracking and Allen memory each need their own choice. Reading does not require either.</p></div></footer>"
